<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 8.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 8.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 8.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on September 1.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 5.0 trillion lire on August 8, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.96 percent and the average rate at 6.98 percent.</p>
</text>
